      {
        "author_name": "Tony M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117330291910829620878/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVP0pkavWV2qYu6PQMvhG3uAlGpT-5IOtMzZX6q0t9Xzdd_aIV4cQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Stephanie at the Gap store in De La Gare was so professional and helpful. Very personable ,knowledgeable and patient.",
        "time": 1768160854,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alanna Albert",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100584694090582962806/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcBqhEJgADzat9Nk94Ffy6LHawnVxFJLbP1nxjAhyYlm34W7v1Mg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "The staff is super friendly. The Gap Warehouse is a great place to shop. They always have merchandise on promotion or sale, and if you subscribe to their emails, you can get an additional discount. This week, I picked up a long sleeve T Shirt that was on sale for $5.99 and got an additional 50% off. Talk about a bargain. Yes, you have to really search, but sometimes you can find the needle in the haystack.",
        "time": 1681522146,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jem Cortez",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102768580770236332869/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLaUqdjw8MYjBNdMRp8rKf72YSJA1xZyMLDmYQeiJJYmJb_HA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Very courteous staff, quick and informative with what items were on sale. Arielle was very helpful",
        "time": 1738449042,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nat Godbout",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112840142754558686029/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLSrgwI_zm6modviPVtuDZKwG1kCcJPtZyA5DaQ2MJOeJ80dA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Get served in French or english, no problem! Good deals, go browse regularly! A little negative point would be that there always seems to be boxes around, racks of clothes to be put away, having you do the bee walk through the \"aisles\". Otherwise, nice place.",
        "time": 1569945594,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kate Chenaux",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111495163884080179270/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocITQ4TYHFErxobikAIs6J2qza6W5XU3zqIcYMur7j5qXal0Ig=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
